  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application would have an unacceptable adverse impact on neighbouring occupiers' living conditions by way of an undue loss of privacy and outlook and as a result of the proposal being an oppressive and overbearing form of development, contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 and SC4 and the aims and objectives of the London Plan. ",
    "Reason : 2 - In the absence of a signed legal agreement to secure a financial contribution towards a future Controlled Parking Zone in the site vicinity, a car permit-free development, adherence to the Considerate Constructors scheme, and a car club membership scheme, the application fails to comply with the intent of Local Plan policies IMP3 and EC2."
